    ],
  },
  {
    title: "Third-party technologies",
    paragraphs: [
      "Third-party services embedded in or connected to the website may place or process their own cookies or similar identifiers.",
      "Examples may include analytics, map services, media platforms, advertising systems or other external integrations where those services are enabled.",
    ],
  },
  {
    title: "Managing cookies",
    paragraphs: [
      "Most browsers provide controls that allow you to block, restrict or delete cookies.",
